      `the total of the sums I still had to pay` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the total, in dollars, of the sums that had fallen payable by you before the parties were discharged but that you had not paid? (0 if none)
      `every sum I have counted was paid or payable in pursuance of the contract before the parties were discharged` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was every sum you have included in those two totals paid, or payable, in pursuance of the contract before the parties were discharged? (Leave out of the totals any sum that was not.)
      `expenses were incurred before the parties were discharged in, or for the purpose of, performing the contract` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the party who received the sum, or was to receive it, incur expenses before the parties were discharged in, or for the purpose of, performing the contract?
      `the amount of those expenses` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the amount of those expenses, in dollars? (0 if none)
