      `the date the parties were discharged` IS A DATE @desc On what date were the parties discharged from performing the contract any further? (If they have not been discharged, give any date: it is not used.)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does the Act reach my contract by its discharge date` IS
    `s 3(1) this Act applies to the contract by its time of discharge` (`my contract from what I know` TRUE `the parties have been discharged from performing my contract any further` `the date the parties were discharged` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)

-- s 3(1).  The date the contract was made makes no difference: Yes whatever the date.
